No, you don't, do you?

133
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:21,039
You don't need anything, do you?

134
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,479
No, I don't need anything.

135
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,599
I don't need anything.

136
