- Arthur...

186
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:03,119
On your feet, Soldier.
On your feet.

187
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,920
Stand the fuck up! Come here.

188
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:10,239
No!

189
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,520
No.

190
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,039
