204
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:02,360
Fuck you!

205
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:05,760
And your fucking plans!

206
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:23,600
That time,
I did let you fucking win.

207
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:31,800
John...

208
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,280
Fuckin' you, John.

209
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:43,040
Fuckin' both of you.

210
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,840
Arthur...

211
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,159
Arthur.

212
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,519
Come here. Come here.
Come here. Come here.

213
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,799
Come here.

214
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,280
Come here.

215
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,319
Come here.

216
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,759
