I'm clean, man.

218
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:05,199
The dragon's fucking gone.

219
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:09,040
Thanks to you. Fucking...
Fucking thanks to you.

220
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,639
