221
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:38,960
Come on.

222
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:43,279
Fucking...
Hey, I'm still fucking here.

223
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:46,080
Pull yourself together, come on.
We have work to do.

224
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,200
Come on!

225
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,959
